{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LookupTable"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Key"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Interp"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Key"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/InterpolatableKey","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"InterpolatableKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:10XestiTools17InterpolatableKeyP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/InterpolatableValue","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"InterpolatableValue","preciseIdentifier":"s:10XestiTools19InterpolatableValueP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Interp"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10XestiTools12InterpolatorP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/Interpolator","text":"Interpolator"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike a dictionary, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"LookupTable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance does not require an exact key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"match. Each entry is a (key, value) anchor, and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/LookupTable\/subscript(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"interpolates between the two entries that bracket a queried key. Every key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"within range of the lookup table therefore yields a meaningful value, not"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"just the keys that were explicitly inserted.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given a key, the lookup table:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Finds the two entries that bracket the key.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Computes the input fraction via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/InterpolatableKey\/fraction(from:through:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps the input fraction through "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/Interpolator\/checkedInterpolate(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to obtain the output fraction."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Blends the values of the bracketing entries via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/InterpolatableValue\/value(of:from:through:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keys beyond the last entry return the value of the last entry; keys before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first entry return the value of the first entry; an empty lookup table"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/LookupTable\/defaultValue","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two entries may share the same key to model an "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"immediate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" transition:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values approaching that key from below interpolate toward the value of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first entry, while querying that key exactly snaps to the value of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"second entry."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The same ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/LookupTable\/interpolator"},{"text":" is applied to every segment between adjacent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entries. Some examples of what a lookup table can model:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"ADSR envelope","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — entries keyed by time mark the boundaries of each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"envelope stage (attack, decay, sustain, release); the interpolator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"controls whether the transitions are linear, exponential, and so on."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Keyframe animation","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — entries keyed by time anchor a property (position,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opacity, scale) at specific moments; all in-between frames are derived via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the interpolator."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Color gradient"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" — entries keyed by a scalar position (0–1) define color"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"stops; any position between stops yields a blended color."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/LookupTable\/subscript(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for lookups, and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/LookupTable\/insert(key:value:extras:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/LookupTable\/remove(key:value:extras:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/LookupTable\/merge(with:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to mutate the lookup"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"table."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/xestitools\/lookuptable"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LookupTable"}],"externalID":"s:10XestiTools11LookupTableV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LookupTable"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"LookupTable","modules":[{"name":"XestiTools"}],"role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"text":"A lookup table that sorts its entries by key — preserving insertion order","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when equal — and interpolates between the keys to produce a value for ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"any","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/XestiTools\/documentation\/XestiTools\/LookupTable\/init(defaultValue:interpolator:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["do